# Tracker and docs

- Product docs are this repository (`docs/`, README, changelog).
- The private tracker is Jira. Use Atlassian MCP for Jira issues only.
- Do not call Confluence tools, CQL search, page/space APIs, or Rovo company-knowledge search. This project does not use Confluence.
- When closing tickets, update Jira and this repo only.
- Never commit tracker URLs, project keys, or ticket ids.
